      Entry: 7
      Data: 16|UnityEngine.TooltipAttribute, UnityEngine.CoreModule
    - Name: tooltip
      Entry: 1
      Data: Where the viewer stands. Each present point keeps its authored direction,
        but the distance along it is recomputed from the creature's own size, so
        a 14 cm clownfish and a 4 m barracuda shoal both fill a comparable part of
        the view. Without this the same eight points serve both phases, and the small
        deep sea species end up as specks. Leave empty to measure from the world
        origin, which is what the ring was laid out around.
