      Data: 141|UnityEngine.TooltipAttribute, UnityEngine.CoreModule
    - Name: tooltip
      Entry: 1
      Data: 'A fish crossing 15 m of open water in a dead straight line at a symmetrical
        speed reads as a prop on a rail. The approach is a curve instead: it sweeps
        out to one side and slightly up, the body points along the path tangent rather
        than at a fixed heading, it rolls into its turns, and the speed surges and
        glides.'
    - Name: 
